WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,960
The rescue team last night

2
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,760
I left all my dogs here.

3
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,660
I chased him all night but couldn't find anyone.

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:17,130
Climb back again and wait for others to be cruel

5
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,450
They are all poor guys

6
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,440
My stomach is full of scratches

7
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,520
torn ear

8
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:25,670
This is a hard fight with the lost group.

9
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:35,360
The bones of your hind legs are all exposed.

10
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,480
Can't be suppressed without killing

11
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,240
Ordinary medicine can't save me. I need better legs. Listen up.

12
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,520
This medicine costs more than 20 points

13
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,400
I smashed all the wound-avoiding grass on you

14
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,090
Remember your new master

15
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,570
I will never abandon you in the future
